    "preamble": "Syed Maideen Ashik Ali vs / on 10 December, 2024 W.P.(Md) No. Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 10.12.2024 Coram: The Honourable Mr.Justice K.Kumaresh Babu W.P.(Md) No.12599 of 2017 and W.M.P.(Md) Nos.9713 and 13661 of 2017 1.Syed Maideen Ashik Ali 2.Mohamed Musthafa Alameen 3.Syed Jalaludeen 4.Mohamed Sahul Hameed ... Petitioners /vs./ 1.The District Revenue Officer cum Additional District Magistrate, Tirunelveli District. 2.The Food Safety Officer, Tenkasi (Town), Tirunelveli District. ... Respondents",
